        <mxCell id="legendBody" value="━━ (주황, 굵게) : AWS → Tanzu 단방향 접근 (AWS Direct Connect)&#10;&#10;       • AWS ECS/Lambda/EMR (10.253.162.64/26, 10.253.162.192/26)&#10;         → MySQL (x.x.x.x:xxxx),  RabbitMQ (10.10.41.211:5672),  Elasticsearch (10.10.41.210:443)&#10;         DNS: h-cloud-api.hanwhalife.com, h-cloud-elasticsearch.hanwhalife.com&#10;&#10;┈┈ (점선) : 외부 K8s → Tanzu DevOps Cluster Harbor 이미지 Pull (단방향, HTTPS 443)&#10;&#10;       • Azure AKS → Harbor&#10;       • NCP 민간 NKS → Harbor&#10;       • NCP 금융 NKS (10.239.193.64/26) → Harbor&#10;&#10;※ 금융망 격리 : NCP 금융존 ↔ NCP 민간존 직접 통신 없음, 모두 Tanzu 중계" style="text;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=15;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
